                <mxCell id="th1" value="&quot;Is my appointment booked now? …and if not, when will I even hear back?&quot; (no date or ETA given — and some just assume it's already booked)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" parent="1" vertex="1">
